          "evidence": [
            "Matching NOT performed for: breast cancer history, comorbidities, screening frequency, weight trajectory",
            "Pre-match T2D was 17.6% in controls vs 53.4% in GLP-1 cohort; matched cohort artificially elevated control T2D to 53.4%"
          ]
        }
      ]
